Z||000013||DXR_DAD||04-17-2000||05:40 PM||||Stimpy, Whatzup! That spoiler was from SuperX after checking around it is an after market for a mustang I wanted something low as mot to take away from the scoop, did not want to over load the rear deck lid with too much. Most people love the look of the rear of my car, and you can see out of the rear window. The GT wing was just too big, too tall, too wide. Love them on the GT's.<P>Thanks SuperX and Tom, the BUTT of my Fiero thanks you! <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> ||||reg||1
